      "id": 65250,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-04T23:57:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Stealth bot and legacy both have 1dr. You don't carry that DR over when you redirect damage. You have to recalculate the damage bonuses for the new target.&nbsp;</p><p>So you can't bounce it down to 0.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:42:37.738Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
