    {
      "id": 65251,
      "name": "JimmytheRat",
      "username": "JimmytheRat",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-05T01:55:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was under the impression that a single source could only redirect a particular instance of damage once.&nbsp; So even if you did have some way to reduce the damage independent of its target (like Smoke Bombs) you couldn't chain it around forever.</p><p>Otherwise you could use Smoke Bombs for an infinite reduction if everyone has the same HP.</p>",
